  "interpretation_boundary": [
    "All outcomes come from exact released figure-source CSV files; no figure is digitized.",
    "Each panel matches the surface training configurations and evaluation endpoint while changing pretrained fine-tuning versus random initialization.",
    "The update regime changes within each panel, so these results test starting-model and training-regime compatibility rather than candidate-environment choice under one fixed trainer.",
    "The raw DFT datasets are not redistributed by the source repository, which prevents reconstruction of additional pre-training environment coordinates.",
    "The panels remain outside the strict fitted bridge and serve as an auxiliary training-regime audit."
